# Byte-exact preservation. The inline application module is pinned by a CSP
# sha256 hash; kw-pq.js is pinned by native Subresource Integrity, and the
# Kaspa SDK files are pinned by SHA-384 checks in the app and service worker.
# Those hashes are computed over the raw file bytes, so ANY line-ending
# conversion (LF <-> CRLF) on clone/checkout would change the bytes and break
# the sealed page. Treat the hashed assets as binary — never convert them.
*.html  -text
*.js    -text
*.mjs   -text
*.wasm  -text
*.json  -text
